      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "お前は人並外れた魔力を持っている。\r\n枯れることなどないわい。",
        "official_en": "You possess a measure of magic far beyond any ordinary soul. ’Twould be a simpler feat to dry the ocean.",
        "real_en": "You have far more magic power than most people. It couldn't simply run dry."
      },
