        "official_en_sha256": "431779b0826defe2326a336a1715a240c4e42abd80bb378a81df9ea09ec752ed"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "さすれば、また魔法が\r\n使えるようになるじゃろう。",
        "official_en": "That shall allow you once again to command the arcane.",
        "real_en": "That should let you use magic again."
