        "official_en_sha256": "8bc5de8f919ee6a3a4ddcd0ad98b04d9bae8c9c42c098f928529605adfe1c4fc"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "その話はいいじゃろう。もう終わったことじゃ。\r\nそれよりも、ちゃんと魔法の修行はしているのか？",
        "official_en": "Let us just say that I had my own reasons. More importantly, Ayaka...how fares your training in the arcane arts?",
        "real_en": "Let's drop that subject. It's over and done with. More importantly, have you been keeping up with your magic training?"
      },
